      383.52,
      310.07,
      441.59
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Aquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intendsto acquire the following land which is required for a publicpurpose.",
