      70.08,
      451.44,
      275.44,
      461.51
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.08,
      471.84,
      310.52,
      541.91
    ],
    "text": "With the following qualification and names in the preliminaryplan No. Pu. 5351 Prepared by Survey General, plot of landabout 0.0094 hectares in the village called Kolimaduwa in 522Ihala Kaduwewa Grama Niladhari Division in Yatakalan PattuSub Division in the Divisional Secretariat of Mahawewa inPuttalam District in North Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
